# Normalise to LF in the repository regardless of the checkout platform. Development
# happens on Windows; CI and every deployment target are Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Golden files are compared byte for byte — a line-ending conversion would make them
# fail on one platform and pass on another, which is the worst possible failure mode
# for a fixture whose whole job is to catch unintended change.
**/testdata/** -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
